diff --git a/libgfortran/ChangeLog b/libgfortran/ChangeLog
index 6beb82ea8f82..35704edc8c6e 100644
--- a/libgfortran/ChangeLog
+++ b/libgfortran/ChangeLog
@@ -1,3 +1,27 @@
+2026-11-03  Jerry DeLisle  <jvdelisle@gcc.gnu.org>
+
+	Backported from master:
+	2026-11-02  Jerry DeLisle  <jvdelisle@gcc.gnu.org>
+
+	PR libfortran/127893
+	* io/io.h (recycle_unit): Declare.
+	* io/unit.c (CACHE_SIZE): Increase to 64.
+	(CACHE_SLOT): New macro.
+	(unit_free_list): New variable.
+	(insert_unit): Reuse a unit from the free list.
+	(recycle_unit, probe_unit_cache, set_unit_cache): New functions.
+	(check_for_recursive): Probe the unit cache first.  Hold
+	unit_rwlock while searching the unit tree.
+	(get_gfc_unit): Probe the unit cache before taking unit_rwlock.
+	Use the direct-mapped cache.  Recycle a closed unit instead of
+	freeing it.
+	(close_unit_1): Clear the unit's cache slot.  Recycle the unit
+	instead of freeing it.
+	(close_units): Free the units on the free list.
+	* io/unix.c (find_file): Take unit_rwlock for writing and recycle
+	a closed unit instead of freeing it.
+	(flush_all_units): Recycle a closed unit instead of freeing it.
+
